{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Demo</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a taste of the bizarre and hilarious world of <i>Blu-Dude in the Quest of Reality in Time</i> in this free demo! This is the <strong>first playable part of the full game</strong>, offering around <strong>15\u201330 minutes of gameplay,</strong> depending on how fast (or curious) you are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a <strong>point-and-click style adventure</strong> with a twist\u2014navigate through colorful, handcrafted environments, talk to eccentric NPCs, and interact with the world around you using only your mouse and wits. Whether you're uncovering secrets, solving quirky puzzles, or just clicking everything to see what happens, there's always something unexpected waiting just around the corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Blu-Dude, a pixelated character just starting to question his reality as he has an existential crisis and questions the meaning of life when all he is are 1s and 0s. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;What is the meaning of life when I'm not even alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Does anything matter? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WHY AM I HERE!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Am I really just a sprite in a game? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Why is everything glitching out?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> And who\u2014<i>or what</i>\u2014is pulling the strings?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s weird, it\u2019s funny, and it\u2019s only just the beginning. Join Blu-Dude in this epic adventure to find the meaning of reality in this simple yet weirdly addictive game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651860/extras/Untitled_design__10_.png?t=1744303057\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651860?t=17443030